# cancel_token_lifecycle — cancellation token lifecycle
# (README §15). Tests task cancellation via token.

CancelTokenLifecycle is project
CancelTokenLifecycle module examplesCancelTokenLifecycle
CancelTokenLifecycle target console
CancelTokenLifecycle entry main

examplesCancelTokenLifecycle is module
examplesCancelTokenLifecycle path examples.cancelTokenLifecycle
examplesCancelTokenLifecycle exports main
examplesCancelTokenLifecycle purpose "Demonstrate cancel token lifecycle"
examplesCancelTokenLifecycle invariant "Cancel tokens are well-formed"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Use cancellation token"
main invariant "Token lifecycle works"

main let canceled immutable Int64 0
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printCanceled
main return okCode

printCanceled is call
printCanceled in main
printCanceled invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printCanceled arg value Int64 canceled
